<report>
<title>Wilcoxon's signed ranks test</title>

<p>@sample_1 vs. @sample_2<br />
Number of non-zero differences ranked = @non_0<br />
@sum</p>

<p>@stats<br />
<pval>Lower side @{p_l:pval}</pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend to be less than zero)<br />
<pval>Upper side @{p_u:pval}</pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend to be greater than zero)<br />
<pval>Two sided @{p_2:pval}</pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend not to be zero)</p>
<block name="noconf">
<p>@reason</p>
</block>
<block name="conf">
<p><ci>@pc</ci><br />
@k   Median difference = @{med_diff:roundu} (<ci>@{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci>)</p>
</block>
</report>
